abstract: >
  GA-Bench provides the source code, prompts, extraction utilities,
  evaluation pipeline, direct-prompt baselines, Structured Reference
  Profile workflow, and scoring scripts associated with the GA-Bench
  project for evaluating IMRaD coverage and cross-section relation
  traceability in scientific graphical abstracts.

keywords:
  - graphical abstracts
  - IMRaD
  - multimodal evaluation
  - scientific document understanding
  - vision-language models
  - digital libraries
  - scholarly communication
